# Dates Test (Start Date and Due Date)

Tests date formats: start date, due date, and date ranges.

The dates in this file are fixed (the "today" of this file is 2026-02-23), so the
date faces depend on the day you open it. For dates relative to today, run
`scripts/gen-testfiles.sh` and open `testfiles/generated/test-dates-relative.altodo`.


## Start Date Only

[ ] Task starting on specific date 2026-03-01 ->
[ ] Task started yesterday 2026-02-22 ->
[ ] Task starting next week 2026-03-03 ->
[ ] Task started last month 2025-01-15 ->


## Due Date Only

[ ] Task with deadline -> 2026-06-30
[ ] Urgent task overdue -> 2026-02-20
[ ] Task due today -> 2026-02-23
[ ] Task due tomorrow -> 2026-02-24
[ ] Task due next week -> 2026-03-02


## Date Range (Start and Due)

[ ] Project task 2026-03-01 -> 2026-05-31
[ ] Short task 2026-02-15 -> 2026-02-20
[ ] Long-term task 2026-01-01 -> 2026-12-31
[ ] Task started, due soon 2026-02-20 -> 2026-02-25
[ ] Task starting soon, due later 2026-02-25 -> 2026-03-15


## Dates in Nested Tasks

[ ] Parent task 2026-03-01 -> 2026-06-30
    [ ] Child task with own dates 2026-03-15 -> 2026-04-15
    [ ] Child task with due date only -> 2026-05-01
[ ] Child task with start date only 2026-04-01 ->
    [ ] Child task overdue -> 2026-02-15
    [ ] Child task started 2026-03-15 -> 2026-03-20


## Dates in Headings

### Q1 Planning 2026-01-01 -> 2026-03-31

[ ] Task under Q1 heading 2026-02-01 -> 2026-02-28


### Sprint Review -> 2026-02-28

[ ] Prepare review materials 2026-02-20 -> 2026-02-27


## Dates with Other Elements

[ ] Task with date and tags 2026-03-01 -> 2026-03-31 #project:alpha #urgent
[ ] + Starred task with date 2026-02-15 -> 2026-02-20
[x] ! Priority task with deadline -> 2026-02-25 #done:2026-03-04T09:10:05+09:00
[@] In-progress task 2026-02-10 -> 2026-02-20 @john

[~] Cancelled task 2026-02-01 -> 2026-02-15


## Edge Cases for Date Filters


[ ] Task due within 30 days -> 2026-03-20
[ ] Task started 3 days ago 2026-02-20 ->
[ ] Task started 10 days ago 2026-02-13 ->
[ ] Task due this week -> 2026-02-28
[ ] Task due this month -> 2026-02-28
[ ] Task starting this week 2026-02-27 ->
[ ] Task starting this month 2026-02-28 ->


## Invalid Date Examples (should be treated as normal text)

[ ] Invalid format 2026/03/01 -> (slash instead of hyphen)
[ ] Missing arrow 2026-03-01 2026-03-31
[ ] Incomplete date 2026-03 ->
